ん、竜の子がかわいい作品を作ってください。\n\nそれとも、天使のような、愛くるしい、大切な子犬のアートワークを作るか。また、「カラフルな子犬」というニックネームもあります（黄色のような柔らかい色が好きです！ :3）。\n\nドラゴン・チャイルドでも、新しい子犬のデザインでも、どれを選んでも...。あなたのアートで幸せになります。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sonosoru/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3728133, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/65b746f9/uploads/origins/23d00e85-199b-4a72-bdfe-fb3568fdd54f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bd1b2d0965850c02bff84ffef2d937c", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/65b746f9/uploads/origins/23d00e85-199b-4a72-bdfe-fb3568fdd54f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=315daf19d54ceebe68d9f70285a253e6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "I wanted to be first ~ can you draw Marron again ? I would love it if you drew her with a new outfit for autumn, and a new hairstyle, but it’s up to you ! Have fun !!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/28104792.marron/gallery#84716885", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 75823, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "今和間田せぃが💤Vクリエイター", "screen_name": "IMAWAMADA_seiga", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1614427994713624577/fnoJftbt.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/949144337429905408/1654256815/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "video"}, {"genre": "music"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc"